and a senior official told the Globe and Mail the changes could someday produce a separate

00:03:42.885 --> 00:03:46.485
Foreign Intelligence Service on the model of the CIA or MI6.

00:03:47.045 --> 00:03:51.705
Budget legislation coming from Ottawa would cover private investment in airports and high-speed

00:03:51.705 --> 00:03:56.725
